% composition-bridge: Follow the rise and fall of a sung phrase and notice how a restrained voice can carry strong feeling.
% composition-context: Cesária Évora's recording introduces morna from Cabo Verde, Kriolu language, migration and longing. This wordless contour study is not a morna and does not borrow the song.
% composition-distance: Entirely original three-note melody; no lyric, chord sequence or rhythmic signature from "Sodade" is reproduced.
